{"seq":2,"slug":"micro-frontend-runtime-integration","title":"微前端运行时集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/federation-and-composition/micro-frontend-runtime-integration","wordCount":819,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"微前端运行时集成\">微前端运行时集成</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>微前端运行时集成是指多个独立构建的前端应用在浏览器中动态组合为一个统一用户体验的架构模式。与构建时集成（monorepo 共享代码）不同，运行时集成允许各子应用独立开发、独立部署、独立升级。2026 年的主流方案包括 Module Federation（模块级集成）、Single-SPA（应用级集成）和 Web Components（组件级集成），每种方案在隔离度、共享能力和复杂度上各有取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"三种运行时集成模型\">三种运行时集成模型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Module Federation</th>\n<th>Single-SPA</th>\n<th>Web Components</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>集成粒度</td>\n<td>模块/组件</td>\n<td>完整应用</td>\n<td>自定义元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架依赖</td>\n<td>需要构建工具插件</td>\n<td>框架无关</td>\n<td>浏览器标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享依赖</td>\n<td>原生支持，版本协商</td>\n<td>手动管理</td>\n<td>Shadow DOM 隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>低到中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时开销</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态共享</td>\n<td>简单（共享 React Context）</td>\n<td>事件总线/CustomEvent</td>\n<td>属性 + 事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立部署</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>MF2 原生支持</td>\n<td>手动类型包</td>\n<td>手动类型定义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"选型决策流程\">选型决策流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Need micro-frontends?&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;Multiple teams with independent deploy?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|No| C[&quot;Use monorepo instead&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|Yes| D{&quot;Mixed frameworks needed?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|Yes| E{&quot;Full app routing per team?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|No| F[&quot;Module Federation&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|Yes| G[&quot;Single-SPA&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|No| H[&quot;Web Components&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Need micro-frontends?\"] --&gt; B{\"Multiple teams with independent deploy?\"}\n    B --&gt;|No| C[\"Use monorepo instead\"]\n    B --&gt;|Yes| D{\"Mixed frameworks needed?\"}\n    D --&gt;|Yes| E{\"Full app routing per team?\"}\n    D --&gt;|No| F[\"Module Federation\"]\n    E --&gt;|Yes| G[\"Single-SPA\"]\n    E --&gt;|No| H[\"Web Components\"]</pre><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"single-spa-集成方案\">Single-SPA 集成方案</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// root-config.ts - Shell 应用路由注册&#10;import { registerApplication, start } from &#39;single-spa&#39;;&#10;&#10;registerApplication({&#10;  name: &#39;@org/navbar&#39;,&#10;  app: () =&gt; System.import(&#39;@org/navbar&#39;),&#10;  activeWhen: &#39;/&#39;, // 始终活跃&#10;});&#10;&#10;registerApplication({&#10;  name: &#39;@org/products&#39;,&#10;  app: () =&gt; System.import(&#39;@org/products&#39;),&#10;  activeWhen: &#39;/products&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;registerApplication({&#10;  name: &#39;@org/checkout&#39;,&#10;  app: () =&gt; System.import(&#39;@org/checkout&#39;),&#10;  activeWhen: &#39;/checkout&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;start({ urlRerouteOnly: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// root-config.ts - Shell 应用路由注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { registerApplication, start } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'single-spa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerApplication</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E