\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          &#x3C;p>{name} is temporarily unavailable&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          &#x3C;button onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{() => window.location.reload()}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Refresh</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      onError</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{(error) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 上报但不阻断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        reportError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ source: name, error });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;AppSkeleton name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{name} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ErrorBoundary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"部署与版本管理\">部署与版本管理</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Team A deploys Product v2.1&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;CDN: /product/v2.1/remoteEntry.js&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;Team B deploys Cart v1.8&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;CDN: /cart/v1.8/remoteEntry.js&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Shell reads manifest&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;User gets latest version of all remotes&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Team A deploys Product v2.1\"] --&gt; B[\"CDN: /product/v2.1/remoteEntry.js\"]\n    C[\"Team B deploys Cart v1.8\"] --&gt; D[\"CDN: /cart/v1.8/remoteEntry.js\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Shell reads manifest\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"User gets latest version of all remotes\"]</pre><p><strong>版本回滚</strong>：每个远程应用部署生成唯一版本标识。Shell 通过 manifest 指向特定版本，回滚仅需更新 manifest 指针。</p>\n<h3 id=\"性能优化清单\">性能优化清单</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>预加载关键远程</strong>：用户进入 Shell 后立即预加载可能需要的远程模块</li>\n<li><strong>共享依赖去重</strong>：通过 singleton 配置确保 React 等框架只加载一份</li>\n<li><strong>路由预取</strong>：hover 导航链接时预加载对应远程应用的入口</li>\n<li><strong>缓存策略</strong>：<code>remoteEntry.js</code> 使用短缓存（5min），<code>mf-manifest.json</code> 用版本号控制</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>2026 状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Module Federation 2.0</td>\n<td>模块级运行时共享</td>\n<td>主流选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Single-SPA</td>\n<td>应用级生命周期管理</td>\n<td>成熟稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>qiankun</td>\n<td>Single-SPA 增强 (蚂蚁)</td>\n<td>中国生态广泛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wujie</td>\n<td>Shadow DOM 沙箱 (腾讯)</td>\n<td>隔离度最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Piral</td>\n<td>微前端平台框架</td>\n<td>企业级功能丰富</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Luigi (SAP)</td>\n<td>企业级微前端</td>\n<td>SAP 生态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>微前端运行时集成的核心价值是&quot;独立交付&quot;——每个团队可以按自己的节奏发布功能，无需等待其他团队或整体发布窗口。选择具体方案时，Module Federation 适合同构建工具、模块级共享的场景（最常见）；Single-SPA 适合异构框架、应用级隔离的场景；Web Components 适合需要最强隔离且交互简单的场景。无论选择哪种方案，都要重点关注三个运维问题：版本兼容性管理、跨应用错误隔离、共享状态一致性。微前端不是技术挑战，而是组织架构在代码中的映射——只有当团队结构确实需要独立部署时，才值得引入运行时集成的复杂度。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"微前端运行时集成","id":"微前端运行时集成"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"三种运行时集成模型","id":"三种运行时集成模型"},{"level":3,"text":"选型决策流程","id":"选型决策流程"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"Single-SPA 集成方案","id":"single-spa-集成方案"},{"level":3,"text":"跨应用状态通信","id":"跨应用状态通信"},{"level":3,"text":"样式隔离策略","id":"样式隔离策略"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"错误隔离与容错","id":"错误隔离与容错"},{"level":3,"text":"部署与版本管理","id":"部署与版本管理"},{"level":3,"text":"性能优化清单","id":"性能优化清单"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"Module Federation 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/federation-and-composition/module-federation"},"next":{"title":"远程组件加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/federation-and-composition/remote-component-loading"}}